WEBVTT

00:04.080 --> 00:05.720
The 18th year of Longwu

00:05.880 --> 00:07.720
You promoted Xuan's largest

00:07.800 --> 00:09.640
Land reform since the founding

00:09.720 --> 00:10.760
A reform

00:10.840 --> 00:13.480
With Grand Tutor Xie Xuan as the core

00:13.600 --> 00:16.200
Began implementation in Qingzhou

00:17.040 --> 00:19.040
Princess, please go persuade the emperor

00:19.280 --> 00:21.120
Even if it's Empress Xie's death anniversary

00:21.240 --> 00:22.720
He can't not eat

00:23.520 --> 00:24.280
Father

00:24.360 --> 00:25.760
Xunyang requests an audience

00:26.320 --> 00:27.720
Yu'er

00:28.200 --> 00:29.600
Come in

00:40.720 --> 00:42.120
Father, don't be sad

00:42.360 --> 00:43.760
Yu'er is with you

00:46.240 --> 00:47.640
Good child

00:48.320 --> 00:49.720
Good child

01:17.160 --> 01:18.560
Father, Your Majesty

01:18.840 --> 01:20.080
Ruolan's death anniversary

01:20.160 --> 01:22.160
No need to bow to me

01:34.880 --> 01:36.547
Has the crown prince come?

01:37.680 --> 01:39.080
Your Majesty

01:39.200 --> 01:40.600
The crown prince

01:41.840 --> 01:43.640
Probably has not come
